{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/93ace2b7b2c738ac456e8a09a2c75b90.avif?t=1764040006\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Your endless nightmare starts here.</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d is an offshoot of the nightmare action shooter \u201cNeverAwake\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake\u201d is a nightmarish twin-stick shooter with a unique worldview and original game rules, and was awarded the \u201dVERMILION GATE AWARD&quot; for the most outstanding work at BitSummit X-Roads in 2022. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>New game rules!A reborn roguelite shooter based on the nightmare world of \u201cNeverAwake\u201d!</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While retaining the core specifications of &quot;NeverAwake,&quot; the game now embraces an arcade shooter style. Players progress through randomly shuffled stages, selecting weapons and accessories between stages for a quick, challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.poster.avif?t=1764040006\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.webm?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/f7531bce447773e88f07d45d00ef63a9.mp4?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Gabe-chan,&quot; an important presence for the main character Rem, joins the battle as her protective partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And completely new stages and new bosses have been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.poster.avif?t=1764040006\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.webm?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/41bd9b6b3e2bec7888fbacd3c80d30a7.mp4?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, we've added long-awaited new accessories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine numerous weapons and accessories to fight off the monsters in your nightmares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rem woke up safely from the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was feeling better and spending her days with a peaceful mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then she realized that she was having nightmares every night again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be the cause of the nightmares?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up again from the deepest nightmares?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.poster.avif?t=1764040006\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.webm?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/cb7d4b1ce6ab6b84227b4a8533cefdbe.mp4?t=1764040006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Playing \u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick out vegetables, dentists, and other monsters and blow away painful childhood memories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique worldview set in a \u201cgirl's nightmare\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn graphics and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique game rules, high retryability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and powerful boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 numerous stages / dozens of tricky bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons and accessories and their combination builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep storytelling and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1764040006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras_big/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1764040006 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is \u201cNeverAwake\u201d?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NeverAwake&quot; has a unique world view with its high quality hand-drawn graphics and its beautiful animation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are not demons...but vegetables and dentists that the girl hates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things and creatures that everyone has had a bad experience with at least once become monsters and attack the main character \u201cRem\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up from her dream again\u2026? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072510?t=1764040006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/ea9bcb5a4773c636dfdbb7652904faea5da94097/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764040006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/a6107026ac942c2c8fc02638ed5e1a84d3447f4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764040006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/a6107026ac942c2c8fc02638ed5e1a84d3447f4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764040006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3675350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/93ace2b7b2c738ac456e8a09a2c75b90.avif?t=1764040006\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Your endless nightmare starts here.</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake FLASHBACK\u201d is an offshoot of the nightmare action shooter \u201cNeverAwake\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNeverAwake\u201d is a nightmarish twin-stick shooter with a unique worldview and original game rules, and was awarded the \u201dVERMILION GATE AWARD&quot; for the most outstanding work at BitSummit X-Roads in 2022. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><