><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay and powerful boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 numerous stages / dozens of tricky bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous weapons and accessories and their combination builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep storytelling and multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1764040006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/extras_big/dd529f018e6576e98fbd3969739cdcc0.avif?t=1764040006 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What is \u201cNeverAwake\u201d?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;NeverAwake&quot; has a unique world view with its high quality hand-drawn graphics and its beautiful animation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are not demons...but vegetables and dentists that the girl hates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Things and creatures that everyone has had a bad experience with at least once become monsters and attack the main character \u201cRem\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Rem be able to wake up from her dream again\u2026? </p>","developers":["Neotro Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072510/0f042fd0a333ffe2568973b720595aac66252cdf/header.jpg?t=1764040006","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Neotro Inc. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\nPublished by Phoenixx Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class